正在调用模型，直接生成 SQL……
SELECT DISTINCT Student.Fname
FROM Student
JOIN Has_Pet ON Student.StuID = Has_Pet.StuID
JOIN Pets ON Has_Pet.PetID = Pets.PetID
WHERE LOWER(Pets.PetType) IN ('cat', 'dog')
GROUP BY Student.StuID, Student.Fname
HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT LOWER(Pets.PetType)) = 2;
与 Gold 结果是否匹配： True
